meta {
  name: Create SuperAdmin
  type: http
  seq: 8
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/auth/create-superadmin
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "email": "superadmin@goddardschool.com",
    "school_id": "{{school_id}}",
    "first_name": "Super",
    "last_name": "Admin",
    "phone_number": "+1-555-0100"
  }
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
}

docs {
  # Create SuperAdmin User

  Creates a new SuperAdmin user for a specific school with pre-verified status.

  **Authentication**: JWT Bearer Token (SuperAdmin role required)

  **Request Body**:
  - `email` (string, required) - SuperAdmin email address
  - `school_id` (UUID, required) - School ID for the SuperAdmin
  - `first_name` (string, required) - First name
  - `last_name` (string, required) - Last name
  - `phone_number` (string, optional) - Contact phone number

  **Response 200 OK**:
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "success": true,
      "message": "SuperAdmin user created successfully. Please check email for confirmation link.",
      "email": "superadmin@goddardschool.com",
      "user_id": "uuid",
      "timestamp": "2025-01-15T10:00:00Z"
    }
  }
  ```

  **Notes**:
  - User is created in both auth.users and public.users
  - is_verified is set to TRUE automatically
  - is_active is set to TRUE automatically
  - Confirmation email is sent to set password
  - Only existing SuperAdmins can create new SuperAdmins
}
